# Tor for the Lantern Zero onion service (spec §3.1). Only an onion
# service: no SOCKS port, no relaying. compose.yaml passes the service
# itself on the command line (`--HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/lz
# --HiddenServicePort ...`), because Tor needs an IP address for the port,
# which comes from .env, and the two lines must stay together in order.
SocksPort 0
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
